# 统一换行：Windows 上检出也必须保持 LF，否则技能文件与文档会产生无意义的 diff，
# 且 SKILLS.lock.json 的哈希会随平台变化。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.md   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
